# Public server information: what players see and connect to. Not secret: both
# values are published inside the client pack.
# Edit the two values and commit to main; CI then publishes your pack with a
# pre-filled server entry named SERVER_NAME that connects to SERVER_PUBLIC_HOST.
# CI publishes dist/mmc3.mrpack whenever SERVER_PUBLIC_HOST is non-empty
# (including the default placeholder mc.example.com); replace mc.example.com
# with your real hostname before sharing the pack with players, or leave it
# empty to skip publishing.
# Plain KEY=value lines; a name may contain spaces, but no single quote.
SERVER_NAME=MMC3 Server
SERVER_PUBLIC_HOST=mc.example.com
